OL,3,GNEWSAHealth worker struck off after
OL,4,Akissing colleague
OL,5,
OL,6,FA health clinician has been struck off
OL,7,Ffor kissing and touching his female
OL,8,Fcolleagues as they tried to care for
OL,9,Fpatients.
OL,11,FStephen Spencer, an operating
OL,12,Fdepartment practitioner at Wrightington
OL,13,FHospital in Appley Bridge, was
OL,14,Fdescribed as "leery" by one colleague
OL,15,Fand left another feeling "violated and
OL,16,Fintimidated".
OL,18,FWhen questioned by his managers he told
OL,19,Fthem the allegations had been "bang out
OL,20,Fof order" and added: "I'm old school
OL,21,Fand will always help women."
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
